QuestGuidance.Register("es",73,{
[2305]="70072EA6\n1\tLibera a los prisioneros (total: 6)\030Derrota a los Ordâkhai (total: 12)\tLos prisioneros están retenidos en jaulas por todo Kôth Rau. Deberías liberarlos y derrotar a los soldados Ordâkhai que encuentres.\n2\tRegresa a la entrada de Damudûr al pie de la montaña\tHas liberado a los prisioneros y derrotado a muchos soldados de Ordâkh. Deberías regresar a Damudûr, la grieta oscura en la base de la montaña.\n3\tDerrota a Kulgath el Devastador\tHas liberado a los prisioneros y derrotado a muchos soldados de Ordâkh, ganándote la atención de un campeón utûgi, Kulgath el Devastador.\n",
[2306]="7002B0F9\n1\tReprende a los borrachos por su mal comportamiento (total: 7)\tLos invitados se encuentran por todo el mercado de la Feria de los Granjeros en Delagua durante el festival. Deberías reprender a los borrachos por su mal comportamiento para mantener la fiesta bajo control. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con el Frontero Boffin.\tEl Frontero Boffin está en Delagua, en la Comarca. Habla con el Frontero Boffin y dile que la fiesta está bajo control.\n",
[2307]="700395DE\n1\tLos Fronteros de la Comarca necesitan tu ayuda. Lleva las fichas que has encontrado a los Fronteros en Cavada Grande y ayuda a la Tierra Media a proteger las fronteras de la Comarca.\t\n2\tHabla con Meg Ganapié en Cavada Grande\tLos Fronteros de la Comarca necesitan tu ayuda. Lleva la ficha que has encontrado a los Fronteros en Cavada Grande y ayuda a la Tierra Media a proteger las fronteras de la Comarca.\n",
[2308]="70071630\n1\tCollect packaged meals\tBatâla has asked you to deliver meals to the residents of Ahâba. You should collect the packaged meals. They are in a bag near Batâla's hut.\n2\tYou have collected the package of meals to deliver to the residents of Ahâba. You should deliver the meals to Beltáni shepherds and hunters around the village.\t\n3\tTalk to Batâla\tYou have delivered meals to the Beltáni. You should return to Batâla.\n",
[2309]="7000EF77\n1\tRecoge Ice Bay Salmon (total: 12)\tTapio te dijo que pescaras donde el mar burbujea y hierve.\n2\tLleva los salmones de la Bahía de Hielo a Tapio\tLleva los salmones de la Bahía de Hielo a Tapio.\n",
[2310]="70053DC2\n1\tDefeat Mordorrim cultists in Parth Daenath (total: 10)\030Defeat Agan-khô in Parth Daenath\tMordorrim can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Mordorrim cultists and their leader, Agan-khô.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Mordorrim cultists.\n",
[2311]="70067CAE\n1\tSpeak with Yitro at his home in lower Halrax\tSeek Yitro at his home in lower Halrax and let him know that you are interested in assisting in bringing the Uruk Akrax the Vile to justice.\n2\tFind a secluded location east outside of Halrax\030Find and eliminate Akraz the Vile\tYitro directed you to find a secluded spot east and north out of Halrax in which to feign weakness to draw out Akraz the Vile.\n3\tHabla con Yitro\tYitro awaits word of your battle against Akraz the Vile at his home in lower Halrax. Return to him.\n",
[2312]="70059767\n1\tInvoca y enfréntate a Akvosh\tAkvosh se encuentra en la Mina Oeste del Bosque Salvaje. Deberías invocar y enfrentarte a Akvosh.\n2\tCompletado\tAkvosh derrotado\n",
[2313]="70071627\n1\tDerrota a Akílu la Festejadora\030Burn animal carcasses (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a bounty to defeat Akílu the Feaster and clean up the Fane of Shahûru. You should travel to the Fane of Shahûru, north of Ahâba and complete the bounty.\n2\tTalk to Shâpar\tYou have defeated Akílu the Feaster and cleaned up the Fane of Shahûru. You should return to Shâpar in Ahâba for your reward.\n",
[2314]="70009A0E\n1\tHabla con Poppy Seaton\tPoppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un saqueador de tumbas llamado Andy Idden llamó tu atención. Si deseas presentarte para esta recompensa, debes hablar con Poppy Silleras.\n2\tDerrota a Andy Idden\tAndy Idden y su perro-lobo están reuniéndose con los trasgos de Tham Andalath, las ruinas en lo alto de una colina al este de Canadiach, en Parth Aduial, al sur de Ost Forod y al norte del camino. Has aceptado la comisión para reclamar la recompensa por Andy Idden.\n3\tHabla con Poppy Seaton\tPoppy Silleras está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Andy Idden y ahora debes informar a Poppy Silleras.\n4\tHabla con Basil Gummidge\tBasilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Andy Idden y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.\n",
[2315]="7001AF97\n1\tEntrega los ojos de barghest a Edith Rosadulce\030Recolecta ojos de barghest (total: 10)\tLos barghests pueden encontrarse en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur. Algunos barghests pueden helar el alma con solo una mirada. Edith Rosadulce, en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, ha ofrecido darte una recompensa por recolectar ojos de barghest tomados de los barghests que habitan en el sur. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2316]="7005A94F\n1\tDefeat Barzglúk\030Defeat bats in Máttugard (total: 12)\tBarzglúk and bats can be found in Máttugard. You should defeat bats.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Barzglúk.\n",
[2317]="7001B250\n1\tLleva las pieles de oso a Sage Semilleno\030Recolecta pieles de oso intactas (total: 10)\tLos osos pueden encontrarse por todos los campos del norte de Bree. Sage Semilleno te pidió que recolectaras pieles de oso de los osos en los campos del norte de Bree y zonas circundantes y se las entregaras. Ha ofrecido pagarte un precio justo por este esfuerzo. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2318]="70009A0B\n1\tHabla con Clark Standish\tClark Cercapiedra está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un saqueador de tumbas llamado Bill Traspié llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Clark Cercapiedra.\n2\tDerrota a Bill Tripper\tBill Traspié está en las ruinas de Tham Varan en Parth Aduial, al sur del cruce de Canadiach. Has aceptado la comisión de la recompensa por Bill Traspié.\n3\tHabla con Clark Standish\tClark Cercapiedra está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Bill Traspié y ahora debes informar a Clark Cercapiedra.\n4\tHabla con Basil Gummidge\tBasilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Bill Traspié y ahora debes hablar con Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.\n",
[2319]="70071AD2\n1\tCollect the hide of Biret-kôda\tBiret-kôda is said to often be found in Uhumêlu, south-east of the Beast-fields. You should defeat Biret-kôda and collect his hide.\n2\tBring the hide to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have defeated Biret-kôda and collected his hide. You should take it to Jiret-menêsh to get your reward.\n",
[2320]="70053DBD\n1\tDefeat Black Númenórean soldiers in Parth Daenath (total: 8)\030Defeat Black Númenórean captains in Parth Daenath (total: 3)\tBlack Númenóreans can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Black Númenórean soldiers and their captains.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Black Númenórean soldiers.\n",
[2321]="7004E910\n1\tDefeat Blackhorn\030Defeat mountain rams (total: 10)\tBlackhorn and other mountain rams can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat rams.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Blackhorn.\n",
[2322]="70045220\n1\tDerrota a la Serpiente Negra\tThe Black Serpent rallies the Men of Harad to greater viciousness as the many forces of Sauron move against Minas Tirith. In addition to his sons, the strongest of the Enemy's forces creep onto the field in search of you and your fellows.\n",
[2323]="7005467C\n1\tDefeat Blood-singer Maurgol\tBlood-singer Maurgol can be found somewhere in the Circle of Madness. Defeat Blood-singer Maurgol.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[2324]="7005FFA2\n1\tCollect bone amulets from the Dead in Câr Bronach (total: 12)\tThe Dead can be found in Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Lísek promises a bounty for the collection of bone amulets from the Dead in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver the bone amulets to Lísek at Grúmachath\tLísek can be found at Grúmachath. You have collected a sufficient number of bone amulets and should now deliver them to Lísek for a bounty.\n",
[2325]="7003FC4E\n1\tSearch the dungeon for hints of Candúr's intentions\tThe dungeon where Candúr was kept can be found in the north-west corner of Calembel. You should see if there is any evidence in the dungeon as to where Candúr might have gone when he escaped.\n2\tTownsfolk who may have seen or heard something of Candúr can be found throughought Calembel. You should speak with townsfolk to see if you can glean any clues to Candúr's whereabouts.\t\n3\tFind a witness in Calembel\tTownsfolk who may have seen or heard something of Candúr can be found throughought Calembel. You should speak with townsfolk to see if you can glean any clues to Candúr's whereabouts.\n4\tSee if anyone saw Candúr just west of Calembel\tCandúr crawled over the wall just west of the woman who witnessed his escape. You should search directly west to see if Candúr left any traces to allow him to be followed.\n5\tSearch north upstream for Candúr\tCandúr, now armed, likely fled north upstream. You should search along the river for signs of Candúr. His trail is not yet cold!\n6\tFind and capture Candúr\tAccording to townsfolk of Calembel, Candúr escaped to the west of town. You should seek and recapture Candúr, the man who murdered his own brother.\n7\tCollect your reward from Laindir\tLaindir can be found in Calembel. You should return to Laindir and collect your reward for defeating the deadly and murderous Candúr.\n",
[2326]="7005467A\n1\tDefeat Captain Hethulos\tCaptain Hethulos can be found somewhere in the Circle of Madness. You should defeat Captain Hethulos.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[2327]="7001AF98\n1\tLleva las reliquias a Edith Rosadulce\030Recolecta reliquias de Cardolan (total: 10)\tCualquiera de las criaturas en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur puede llevar abalorios y reliquias del reino de Cardolan. Edith Rosadulce intercambiará materiales de artesanía por cualquier reliquia de Cardolan que encuentres. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2328]="7003FCBD\n1\tQuestion witnesses at Bar Elir\tBar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel. You should speak with the farmers at Bar Elir to hear their report of the chicken-thief directly.\n2\tFind the chicken-thief's hideout\tThe chicken-thief is reported to have likely gone west of Bar Elir in southern Lamedon, likely taking cover in the shelter of trees and rocks in the hills. You should search for the chicken-thief.\n3\tCollect stolen chickens (total: 6)\tThe chicken-thief has gathered chickens west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon. The thief is nowhere to be found, but the chickens should be returned to their coop.\n4\tCatch the chicken-thief\tThe chicken-thief's hideout is west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon. See what the chicken-thief was cooking while you wait for him to return.\n5\tReturn the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir\tBar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel. You should return the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir.\n6\tCollect your reward from Laindir\tLaindir can be found in Calembel in Lamedon. You should return to Laindir in Calembel and tell him that you found the hideout, and defeated the thief.\n",
[2329]="7006AA3A\n1\tReach the Hakâri camp to the north of Jadambor\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of Hakâri in Ghâs Hejai. It can be found to the north of Jadambor.\n2\tDefeat Hakâri within Ghâs Hejai (total: 12)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of Hakâri in Ghâs Hejai. It can be found to the north of Jadambor.\n3\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists.\n",
[2330]="7006AA3B\n1\tReach Jalkhûl to the south-east of Jadambor\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of spiders in Jalkhûl. It can be found to the south-east of Jadambor.\n2\tDefeat spiders within Jalkhûl (total: 12)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of spiders in Jalkhûl. It can be found to the south-east of Jadambor.\n3\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of spiders\t\n",
[2331]="7006AA3E\n1\tDestroy the northern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\030Destroy the eastern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\030Destroy the southern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to clear out rat nests in the area. There is one to the north, one to the east, and one to the south of Jadambor.\n2\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed.\n",
[2332]="700453E5\n1\tDefeat Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men Statues (total: 10)\tGhûrdhos can be found near Púkel-men statues in Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men statues.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men statues.\n",
[2333]="700413B6\n1\tRoughed up corsairs at the Fallen Beacon (total: 8)\tThe Fallen Beacon can be found on the border of Lamedon and Ringló Vale. You should defeat corsairs at the Fallen Beacon.\n2\tSpeak with Jajax\tJajax is located inside the Ethring tavern. You should speak with Jajax.\n",
[2334]="7001C071\n1\tLleva la carne a Glaednoth\030Recolecta carne crujiente de gusano (total: 10)\tLos gusanos se pueden encontrar por todo el pantano de Harloeg. Glaednoth se encuentra en Ost Haer, en el extremo sur de Harloeg. Glaednoth te ha pedido que recojas carne de los gusanos de Harloeg. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son misiones repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión se puede completar tres veces.\n",
[2335]="7005FFA5\n1\tDefeat Crótharc and collect his horns\tCrótharc can be found somewhere in the eastern reaches of Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Rádek promises a bounty for the horns of the mighty hill-ram, Crótharc, in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver Crótharc's horns to Rádek at Grúmachath\tRádek can be found at Grúmachath. You have claimed Crótharc's horns as a trophy and should now deliver them to Rádek for a bounty.\n",
[2336]="70053DB9\n1\tDefeat darkwaters in Rath Dúath (total: 12)\tDarkwaters can be found in Rath Dúath. You should defeat darkwaters.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated darkwaters.\n",
})
